      </figure>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Maps and token placement</strong> - upload your own scene assets and drop them directly into the live table.</li>
        <li><strong>Visibility control</strong> - hide or reveal objects as encounters unfold.</li>
        <li><strong>Layer management</strong> - separate terrain, objects, and translucent overlay work without cluttering the board state.</li>
        <li><strong>Pins and portals</strong> - move between rooms, floors, or regional maps with less table friction.</li>
        <li><strong>Chat and dice</strong> - keep quick rolls and table messages inside the same session surface.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="no-signup">
