      <p>
        For one-shots, test sessions, and fast recurring groups, account creation is often the first source of friction.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Share one join link with players.</li>
        <li>Let players open the table in the browser without signup.</li>
        <li>Move into persistent campaign tools later if the group sticks together long-term.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Need the broader landing page? Start with <a href="/simple-virtual-tabletop-no-player-accounts">No-Signup Virtual Tabletop</a>.</p>
